    "expression": {
      "type": [
        "number",
        "string",
        "boolean"
      ],
      "description": "A number, or an expression with + - * / ( ) ?: < <= > >= == != && || ! and min max floor ceil round snap, textw('style', 'text') and texth('style', 'text', width). Names: W H X Y (the box around it), x y w h (its own, once worked out), u (a whole pixel), font_size, hot, pressed, i (the round of a repeat), flow (in a column), $palette_entry, @screen_number, id.right and the like of a sibling, hit('name') and note('name') of the screen, constants, lets and a part's arguments."
    },
